<title>POLAND: GPRD MARCH LOSS FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>GPRD MARCH LOSS FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPRD Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		   1997	1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.50 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.50 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.41 vs   0.97</p>
<p> Sales		    5.46 vs   2.33</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net loss		 4.94 vs   2.99</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   4.94 vs   2.99</p>
<p> Operating loss	 5.75 vs   3.24</p>
<p> Sales		   10.19 vs   5.57</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish road building company is</p>
<p>Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
